Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nproblems, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon,\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated, It\Ncrushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world\NThere is a place I want to take
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, let's head for it then.\NBut after the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.18,0:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're in\Ngood shape to me. Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison made me hungry Should\NI catch some more fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We got an island coming up\Nsoon that'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen, I'll drop some\Ninfo while I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama owns 34 islands around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,is right in the center\Nof them all. So many.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And just to give you a fair warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one of those islands has a minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that runs the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So all the islands and all the\Nwater around here is Mama's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We call it Kaku Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Very sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was an enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.72,0:03:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I stole it from the pirates myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll present it to Mama in\Nperson once we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then am I to assume you have some\Ntantalizing treats hidden in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm sure\NMama will be thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise gift, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, son, I don't want you reporting\Na thing about this ship, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Pecan, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The fountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The houses! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all made of chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole chocolate town?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Treats do come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's all sorts of people!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it! I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This town is the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like water, only chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chaka found it a\Nfine choice, my good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A chocolate bathhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They bought my cover\Nstory, but they bought me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but we better not stay long just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So do what you gotta do, then scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a rush anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, this is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's pretty neat, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I love it. Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Brooke, do I look like a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Brook...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take another day before\Nwe make it to Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure you get all you\Nneed, especially food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, have any binoculars\Nby chance? That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.40,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's not just humans, but\Nall kinds of people living here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I even see minx!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a wonderland! Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Mama's dream for\Nthis country is all about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans, minks, fishmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,long arms, long legs, dwarves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A land where every race in the world can\Nlive together without discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where all creations exist in harmony. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she made this country? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at Mama's\Nlittle slice of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A place befitting a ruler of her stature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, we're on Cacao Island,\Nrun by the Minister of Chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The settlement is called Chocolatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awesome name!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.36,0:07:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in town is made of chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds delicious,\Nbut can I eat it? Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you can eat all\Nthe chocolate you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, what would be the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's some important rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's against the law to eat\Nthe root-tile chocolates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, rain and snow\Nwill get inside the houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Window Glass is the Minister\Nof Candy's jurisdiction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And construction posts are handled\Nby the Minister of Biscuits?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and anything that isn't chocolate is\Neither private or public property.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, were you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too complicated, so no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are the panties here\Nmade of chocolate as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not here for sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the food and then get out. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay on the ship\Nsince they know me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I really love chocolate, so\Nyou gotta get me some. Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Put on your disguise, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There were people waiting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy and Chopper already went to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's gonna happen if they
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,find out that I brought\NMama's enemies here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of maniacs, we'll all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry, we'll know\Nwhere they are soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was just the chocolate\Nwalls, we could easily build more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you eat the entire cafe, you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate a ton of candy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention marshmallows,\Nalmonds, and jelly beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.62,0:09:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Snackalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sort this out at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good reason for\Nthis. No? Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The nerve of you. How seamless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be arrested at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but we can't make a scene, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Mr. Chaka, police?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's flying that's neat. Carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the owner. Hello, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the owner of the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These D-gens have made\Nquite a mess of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you leave this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't what we agreed to at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do a job, you have\Nto finish it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I sure don't. That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, what's that on her shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.00,0:10:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:11:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are my chocolate-covered biscuits\Nand jam not good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, try these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.27,0:11:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaka Police, you must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, the cafe\Nwas about to expire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hired these two to eat\Nthe whole building for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.68,0:11:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they were a demolition crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but next time you should\Nput a sign out when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.44,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,doing your job and wait\Nfor the customers to leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, I'll be taking my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I apologize for the\Ndisturbance, everyone. Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They had me worried there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.06,0:11:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it wasn't a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about your engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Lady Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your wedding day is coming\Nup soon, so don't overwork yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:12:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in town wishes\Nnothing but the best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.64,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did she save them? I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's just really nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune favors the Pirate\NKing to be at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice chatting with you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know people in this town, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So your name's Pudding, huh? Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved our butts. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.36,0:12:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be\Nthanking all of you. Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that it was too delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The chocolate at the cafe is the\Nnew blend I just came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did it melt\Nin your mouth properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I added milk to cocoa butter and mixed\Nit with a high-purity beet sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was needed for three days\Nstraight at 29 degrees precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand any of that,\Nbut your walls were awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They were awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That means all my hard work paid off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this woman real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like making chocolate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta tell you, I'm\Nwild about sweet stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, just smelling chocolate\Neverywhere is enough to make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating's good, too. That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be rude, especially\Nsince you've been so generous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but we really need to get going. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a shame. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you have a cup of tea first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to follow up all those sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why, that sounds perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this shouldn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She is such a sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I forgot to ask your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a king of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How a singer will it be till\Nwe have our tea for tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.82,0:15:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Only three days, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How long is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what is to be done with Jermason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll have him, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.22,0:15:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Couches, sofas, dressers, teapots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All will be shall be,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All will be shall be.\NAll kings are lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,all kings are lovely, that design, divine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and the prize, only mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,our remedies, take them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but will flow if they resist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,mercy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to make a cake so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The finest cake you'll ever eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,such sweet insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea time. And hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,what a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some strawberry jam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I don't give a damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't show your\Nsleep, they'll be low!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Social and bleeding is sacrificial!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a dreamland\Nwith joy never ending!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is welcome,\Nour harmony is blending!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To the land!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I heard that he's here. Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,truly near yes he is oh it's true
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind strong. Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I look closer,\NI do recognize you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all dead men walking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You people aren't really the\NStraw Hat Pirates, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's crewmates are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.62,0:17:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you know Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seriously the lady\Nwho's supposed to marry Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big mom is your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It is her. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful bride to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You said bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you aren't even Mama's allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get through Tart's security?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If she finds out you're here, you'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have come to her territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a very scary pirate. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And here's the Straw Hats, so\Nyou're all scary pirates, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.72,0:18:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.30,0:18:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't attack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, want me to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You plan to take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, Mama is forcing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the way she does business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to strengthen her pirate group,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,she often arranges\Nmarriages for her children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All of us have given up\Non marrying for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can either accept it or run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my older sisters did the latter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She ran off to sea a while\Nback in search of a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of her choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll pardon my curiosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the invitation says you're the\N35th daughter of the Charlotte?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There can't be that many, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.22,0:19:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 39 of us\Ngirls, and 46 boys, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So Mama's actually got\N85 children altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of kids! That many?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully your dad helps\Nout around the house, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama has 43 husbands, so if you count her\Nplus us and our fathers, it's 129 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.95,0:20:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of my older brothers and sisters\Nalready have children of their own, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.20,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you include them,\Nthe total's even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost all the Big Mom pirates\Nare our blood relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyway, Pudding, have you\Nand Sanji met each other yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah, but just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyebrows are rather strange,\Nbut he's a very kind and gentle man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower, flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes his eyes turn into hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but he taught me so\Nmuch about making sweets
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that I don't really mind things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Flower, flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We like the same things,\Nand he's so manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.00,0:21:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hear his legs are black,\Nbut it's all the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He is cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that's not why\Nthey call him Black Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's our Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lots of awesomeness about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I recognize that expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You love him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in love with Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Be honest with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, uh, Mama's\Ndecision can't be overturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I chose my husband,\Nthen, well, he would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Sanchi, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.36,0:22:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I can't say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So Sanchi's engaged to\Na darling young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And for once it isn't someone\Nwho rejects all his advances?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had eyes, they'd\Nbe heart-shaped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I think\Nwe'd better tie her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's clearly going to\Ntell them where we are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and if they find us here\Non the outer islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no way we'll\Nmake it to where Sanji is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't treat her like that. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep her quiet somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that girl\Nis a daughter of big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know But she's\Nobviously afraid of her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.58,0:22:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why she'll tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't know that for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.04,0:23:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If I try, I can abandon\Nmy feelings for Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Toto Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave us their blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.56,0:23:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Celebrating the same goes\Nfor the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mama's really looking\Nforward to the wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cake no one can disobey\Nan order from her so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't marry\Nfor love despite that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dreamed about it\Nsince I was little. I
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.82,0:23:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,wondered about my soulmate\Nwhat he'd be like? You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:24:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I got to meet my Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised the groom\Nwas someone so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But right before the end of our\Nmeeting, he told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I really would like to marry\Nyou, but I'm afraid I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to go back\Nto be with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:24:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.28,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi rejected a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.16,0:24:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.66,0:24:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If he said no to you, then\Nhe must really love our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.56,0:24:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And that feeling is obviously mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.98,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're all here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.82,0:25:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you are risking your lives\Nby traveling to Toto Land to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what Mama says, I can't marry\NSanji if that isn't what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.24,0:25:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.22,0:25:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.12,0:25:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clear to me now how\Nimportant he is to his crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can't take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the heart wants what\Nthe heart wants, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.84,0:25:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why, if this is what\NSanji's heart wants, then I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.76,0:25:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take this route.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.34,0:25:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the one path you can\Nuse to avoid Mama's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only her children know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.80,0:25:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And that leads to Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you follow this map, eventually\Nyou should reach Whole Cake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.80,0:25:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mama won't let him\Nslip through her fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.64,0:25:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we rendezvous tomorrow\Nat the coast right here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.82,0:26:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll bring Sanji\Nthere, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.84,0:26:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think Big Mom will punish you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.22,0:26:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama and I are family,\Nso don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.86,0:26:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in hostile territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.44,0:26:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Puddin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear, this must be painful for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.62,0:26:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Sanji care about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.76,0:26:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Warms my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is if I had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is heartbreaking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.62,0:26:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll just try and\Nfocus on my future suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.92,0:26:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll be even more incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.22,0:26:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're such a gracious young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe you're\Nthe child of someone so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.72,0:26:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.14,0:26:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.86,0:27:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding, your\Nescort is ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.08,0:27:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.98,0:27:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lady, but you must\Nstop working until after the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop working?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to make preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.58,0:27:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.64,0:27:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the groceries you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.54,0:27:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to pick them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.10,0:27:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.12,0:27:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You got all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.03,0:27:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.26,0:27:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate burgers, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.18,0:27:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We have enough, Luffy. Now let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.90,0:27:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckham's is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.12,0:27:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want one really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate fried chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.08,0:28:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.84,0:28:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.78,0:28:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he pooping?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.80,0:28:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the toilet. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a message in the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.36,0:28:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.44,0:28:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.22,0:28:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Peckhams write that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.58,0:28:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else was aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Were we attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Peckhams go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.18,0:28:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he got abducted?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.68,0:28:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just speculating but maybe we've been\Nfound out regardless this is quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.70,0:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're trying to tell us that if we\Ndon't turn back something bad will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right everyone keep\Nthat in mind i guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.88,0:29:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.74,0:29:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is starting to get real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All done here? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.00,0:30:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.32,0:30:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.54,0:30:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You left my country in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.98,0:30:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You, germ of bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.96,0:30:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you to hell\Nwhere you belong, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this took four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.36,0:30:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's wedding is soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.66,0:30:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.50,0:30:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or your war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.74,0:31:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.68,0:31:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these pathetic countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.24,0:31:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kept this up for two whole years?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.74,0:31:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Got the commission?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The world may call them demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.44,0:31:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To us. Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These are angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Put down your weapons, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.46,0:31:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, the war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Jarba!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.30,0:32:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jarba, number six, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.64,0:32:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jarba, Jarba, Jarba, Jarba.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding's in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.42,0:32:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make it to Whole Cake\NIsland in two days, easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.04,0:32:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.52,0:32:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.66,0:32:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.58,0:32:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kali!
